<title>UK: Select sets U.S. offer price at $10.50.</title>
<headline>Select sets U.S. offer price at $10.50.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-based recruitment company Select Appointments Plc said on Tuesday that it has set the price of its U.S. public offering at $10.50 per ADS.</p>
</text>
